{"unit_id": "WSIKUN5__dsh-plugin-mumu#feature-observe", "repo": "WSIKUN5/dsh-plugin-mumu", "commit": "f7c10fe46316b208c6debc51e2af43be36c00146", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-plugin-mumu** 的功能「模拟器截图」：截取 MuMu 渲染窗画面，可裁剪区域、缩放并返回图片或文件路径，也可对颜色区域做探针统计。通过 mumu_observe 触发，输出截图尺寸、坐标基准和图像。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:460-509"]}
{"unit_id": "WSIKUN5__dsh-plugin-mumu#feature-tap", "repo": "WSIKUN5/dsh-plugin-mumu", "commit": "f7c10fe46316b208c6debc51e2af43be36c00146", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-plugin-mumu** 的功能「点击与滑动」：在渲染窗像素坐标点击或分步拖动，可用于点击控件、滚动列表和拖动滑块；操作前可检查鼠标位置。由 mumu_tap 或 mumu_swipe 触发，输入坐标并返回操作结果。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:530-563", "index.js:573-610", "lib/mumu-worker.ps1:512-633"]}
{"unit_id": "WSIKUN5__dsh-plugin-mumu#feature-android", "repo": "WSIKUN5/dsh-plugin-mumu", "commit": "f7c10fe46316b208c6debc51e2af43be36c00146", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-plugin-mumu** 的功能「输入与应用管理」：发送按键、ASCII 文本或 Android shell 命令，并管理应用。通过 mumu_key、mumu_text、mumu_shell、mumu_app 调用。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:611-740", "lib/mumu-worker.ps1:634-731"]}
{"unit_id": "WSIKUN5__dsh-plugin-mumu#feature-wait", "repo": "WSIKUN5/dsh-plugin-mumu", "commit": "f7c10fe46316b208c6debc51e2af43be36c00146", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-plugin-mumu** 的功能「等待画面条件」：在本地轮询模拟器画面条件，条件满足时可立即执行点击，避免为短时画面变化反复请求模型。通过 mumu_wait 输入等待条件并返回匹配结果。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:742-798", "lib/mumu-worker.ps1:828-937"]}
{"unit_id": "WSIKUN5__dsh-plugin-mumu#feature-ocr", "repo": "WSIKUN5/dsh-plugin-mumu", "commit": "f7c10fe46316b208c6debc51e2af43be36c00146", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-plugin-mumu** 的功能「离线 OCR 与图像扫描」：使用 Windows OCR 识别画面文字并返回坐标，也可扫描区域亮暗列与亮度。通过 mumu_ocr 或 mumu_scan 调用。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:798-925", "lib/mumu-ocr.ps1:98-136", "lib/mumu-worker.ps1:938-1113"]}
